{"id":"event_ce006_1_04_s","cat":"event","group":{"id":"ev40079","label":"MEMORIES TELLER · Part 1"},"label":"Blind Faith and Devotion: A","stage":null,"prev":"event_ce006_1_intermission_01","next":"event_ce006_1_04_e","speakers":{"ce006_03":"Lily","elegg":"Elegg","ce006_npc_01":"Adam","privaty":"Privaty","neon":"Neon","rapi":"Rapi","anis":"Anis"},"icons":{"ce006_03":"si_c852_00_s","elegg":"si_c500_00_s","ce006_npc_01":"si_c853_00_s","privaty":"si_c170_00_s","neon":"si_c011_00_s","rapi":"si_c010_00_s","anis":"si_c012_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"event_ce006_1_04_s_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_03","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_04_s_1","text":"... I'm sorry, but is there any chance you could come down?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"artcity_d","bgArt":"artcity_d","image":null,"bgm":"bgm_story_whosdumber","movie":null,"shown":["elegg","ce006_03","ce006_npc_01","privaty","neon","rapi","anis"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_04_s_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_04_s_2","text":"Let me have my fun!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_04_s_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_04_s_3","text":"*Sniiiifffffff*","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_04_s_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_npc_01","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_04_s_4","text":"Anybody who recognizes the greatness of the Tetrapod must be a good person.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_04_s_5","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_04_s_5","text":"Upon joining the group and gazing upon the Tetrapod, Elegg completely loses it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_04_s_6","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_04_s_6","text":"Clinging to one of the thrusters, she rubs her whole body against it and sniffs it vigorously.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_04_s_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_04_s_7","text":"I can't believe such a magnificent transport aircraft exists!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_04_s_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_04_s_8","text":"I know that we just met, but would it be okay if I took this apart and got a better look? Please?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_04_s_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_03","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_04_s_9","text":"If, by your own admission, you know it's an inappropriate question, why the heck would you ask it?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_04_s_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_04_s_10","text":"But taking something apart is the same as assembling it, just in reverse! I'll be able to put it back together perfectly.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_04_s_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_03","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_04_s_11","text":"Don't you dare. Hurry up and come down, will you?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_04_s_12","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_04_s_12","text":"I don't even know how she got up there.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_04_s_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_04_s_13","text":"That's why she's perfect for this kind of mission, in more ways than one.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_04_s_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_04_s_14","text":"Now then, let me give you a rundown of the current situation.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"none","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_04_s_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_04_s_15","text":"Other than those three showing up, no anomalies caused by the D-Wave have been observed.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"bgm_destroyingcalamity","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_04_s_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_04_s_16","text":"However, the severed arm of a Nikke was retrieved from the lake.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_04_s_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_04_s_17","text":"... While some of your members were fishing, no less.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_04_s_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_04_s_18","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_04_s_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_04_s_19","text":"The combat assistant robot found in the scrap heap seems to know something about this, and keeps hinting that there might be something on the ground floor, but refuses to elaborate.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_04_s_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_04_s_20","text":"In order for us to investigate the ground floor further, the electricity flowing throughout the lake first needs to be cut off and the water drained.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_04_s_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_04_s_21","text":"It seems the power is most likely coming from an unmanned power plant nearby, so the power there needs to be shut off.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_04_s_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_04_s_22","text":"Did I get everything?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_04_s_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_04_s_23","text":"That's correct.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_04_s_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_04_s_24","text":"A lovely summary, Oh Mighty One.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_04_s_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_04_s_25","text":"Good. Then let's head to the power plant. I'll lead the way.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_04_s_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_04_s_26","text":"Elegg. Come down.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_04_s_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_04_s_27","text":"Huh? Why?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_04_s_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_04_s_28","text":"We need to go to the power plant.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_04_s_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_04_s_29","text":"Why?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_04_s_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_04_s_30","text":"We need to cut the electricity flowing inside the lake.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_04_s_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_04_s_31","text":"The lake is electrified?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_04_s_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_04_s_32","text":"No kidding.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_04_s_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_04_s_33","text":"Anyway, we don't have to bother with all that. I saw a dedicated generator for this facility near the entrance.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_04_s_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_04_s_34","text":"All we need to do is go there and pull the lever.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_04_s_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_04_s_35","text":"... Excuse me?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_04_s_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_04_s_36","text":"If I take care of that, will you let me help you repair the Tetrapod?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_04_s_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_04_s_37","text":"Uh... Yeah, sure. I guess.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_04_s_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_npc_01","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_04_s_38","text":"Hey, why aren't we being consulted?!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_04_s_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_03","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_04_s_39","text":"Just leave her. Let's see what happens.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_04_s_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_04_s_40","text":"Hehe. Okay.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_04_s_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_04_s_41","text":"I'm sorry, Mr. Tetrapod, but we'll have to part ways for just a little bit.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_04_s_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_04_s_42","text":"Mwah mwah mwah!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_04_s_43","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_04_s_43","text":"Elegg kisses the Tetrapod repeatedly before finally coming down.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_04_s_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_npc_01","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_04_s_44","text":"Jeez, she really loves the Tetrapod.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_04_s_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_03","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_04_s_45","text":"Are you into this kind of stuff as well, Adam?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_04_s_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_npc_01","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_04_s_46","text":"No!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_04_s_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_04_s_47","text":"Let's get going!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_04_s_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_03","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_04_s_48","text":"Can I tag along? I want to see what the generators in this world look like.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_04_s_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_04_s_49","text":"Of course.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_04_s_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_04_s_50","text":"Commander, Elegg, and I are gonna head out, along with Lily over here.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_04_s_51","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_04_s_51","text":"Wouldn't it be better for all of us to go?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_04_s_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_04_s_52","text":"No. We should give the newly introduced characters a chance to shine.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_04_s_53","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_04_s_53","text":"... Okay, fine. Reach out if anything happens.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_04_s_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_04_s_54","text":"Will do!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null}]}